    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109201" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποστᾰχύομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yield increase
				like ears of corn</i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσταχύοιτο βοῶν γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.212
				</span></i>
			.—Later we find an 
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσταχύεσκον ἴουλοι</span>
			as v. l. (ap.Sch.) in <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.972
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-</span> codd.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
			</span></i>).</div>
